sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Member as 微信小程序会员
    participant Mini as 微信小程序
    participant Server as Server API
    participant Store as DB / Store
    participant TV as TV 签课屏
    participant Coach as Coach 端

    Member->>Mini: 打开今日课程
    Mini->>Server: GET /api/mini/courses?date=...
    Server->>Store: 查询场馆可预约场次
    Store-->>Server: bookingSessions
    Server-->>Mini: 课程列表 + 余量 + 预约状态

    Member->>Mini: 选择课程并确认预约
    Mini->>Server: POST /api/mini/bookings
    Server->>Store: 校验容量 / 窗口 / 重复预约
    Store-->>Server: 校验通过
    Server->>Store: 创建 booking
    Server-->>Mini: 预约成功

    TV->>Server: GET /api/tv/check-in/current
    Server->>Store: 查询当前签到窗口课程
    Store-->>Server: bookingSession
    Server->>Store: 创建或刷新 QR token
    Server-->>TV: 课程信息 + 小程序码 + 过期时间
    TV->>TV: 展示二维码和签到人数

    Member->>TV: 扫描二维码
    TV-->>Member: 微信小程序码
    Member->>Mini: 打开扫码签到页
    Mini->>Server: POST /api/mini/check-in token
    Server->>Store: 校验 token / 场馆 / 预约 / 签到窗口
    Store-->>Server: booking 有效
    Server->>Store: 创建 attendance 并更新 booking
    Server-->>Mini: 签到成功

    TV->>Server: GET /api/tv/check-in/stats
    Server->>Store: 查询签到统计
    Store-->>Server: bookedCount / checkedInCount / recent
    Server-->>TV: 最新签到状态
    TV->>TV: 刷新人数并显示成功反馈

    Coach->>Server: GET /api/coach/booking-sessions/:id/bookings
    Server->>Store: 查询预约和签到名单
    Store-->>Server: lists
    Server-->>Coach: 已预约 / 已签到 / 未到

    Member->>Mini: 课后提交 RPE 和心率
    Mini->>Server: POST /api/mini/feedback
    Server->>Store: 校验已签到并保存反馈
    Server-->>Mini: 保存成功

    Coach->>Server: GET /api/coach/booking-sessions/:id/feedback-summary
    Server->>Store: 聚合 RPE / 心率 / 提交率
    Store-->>Server: summary
    Server-->>Coach: 课后反馈概览
